              "id": "Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDg5NDg4MjQyNDkwMTYzMjA=",
              "text": "A few nights ago I was out walking my dog Foxx, I noticed two of the neighborhood street lights were out, I asked my Bot to please look up the two closest street lights from my home by proximity and submit a report to get them repaired.... That's it, that was the prompt, all the information I gave it, from there it was able to look up and find the asset numbers assigned to the street lights by using the utility company's website. It submitted the repair requests and had the responses routed to my email.\nBoth lights were repaired within two days. \n\nAbsolutely outstanding 👏🏻\n\nJob well done @Grok @Bot"
             }
            }
